WEBVTT

00:01:59.147 --> 00:02:01.229
or their personalities.

00:02:01.229 --> 00:02:03.956
We wouldn't dream of fitting a little girl

00:02:03.956 --> 00:02:07.352
with the prosthetic limb of a grown man.

00:02:07.352 --> 00:02:10.656
So why then the same prosthetic voice?

00:02:10.656 --> 00:02:11.947
It really struck me,

00:02:11.947 --> 00:02:15.098
and I wanted to do something about this.

00:02:15.098 --> 00:02:17.051
I'm going to play you now a sample

00:02:17.051 --> 00:02:20.339
of someone who has, two people actually,

00:02:20.339 --> 00:02:22.107
who have severe speech disorders.

00:02:22.107 --> 00:02:25.337
I want you to take a listen to how they sound.

00:02:25.337 --> 00:02:27.694
They're saying the same utterance.

00:02:27.694 --> 00:02:30.126
(First voice)